========================================================================================================
0.  CENSUS + INSTRUMENT SANITY.  u_k = theta(gamma_k)/pi = k - 3/2 - S(gamma_k) is EXACT,
    so a MISSED zero makes k-u jump by 1 for all later k and var blows up.  Small var
    (~0.1) is therefore an independent census gate.  W = window in t.
